# React performance

## Bundle

- Import Framer Motion only in client components that animate
- No barrel `index.ts` re-exports — import from concrete files
- `next/dynamic` for below-fold heavy blocks if needed

## Renders

- Colocate state in leaf components (e.g. `WaitlistForm` owns submit state)
- Do not lift scroll/nav blur state to page root unnecessarily
- Memoize only when profiling shows benefit — avoid premature `memo`

## Motion

- Use `viewport={{ once: true }}` for scroll reveals
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: disable stagger/ticker animation in CSS
- Ticker strip: **CSS only** (`ticker-track` in globals.css), no JS marquee lib

## Images

- Landing has no hero image per spec — do not add stock photos
- If icons needed later: inline SVG or emoji per spec, not icon font bundles
